{"id":"e03t3","name":"Top Doctors by Daily Utilization","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The clinic manager wants to see, every day, which doctors had the busiest schedule compared with the time they made available.</p>\n<p>You are given two tables.</p>\n<p><b>availability</b> - one row per doctor and per day the doctor opened slots:</p>\n<ul><li><code>doctor_id</code> - the ID of the doctor;</li><li><code>day</code> - the date;</li><li><code>minutes_open</code> - the number of minutes the doctor made available that day (integer, can be <code>0</code>).</li></ul>\n<p><b>bookings</b> - one row per booking:</p>\n<ul><li><code>booking_id</code> - the ID of the booking;</li><li><code>doctor_id</code>, <code>day</code> - the doctor and the date of the booking;</li><li><code>minutes</code> - the length of the booking (integer);</li><li><code>status</code> - <code>'confirmed'</code>, <code>'done'</code> or <code>'cancelled'</code>.</li></ul>\n<p>The <b>utilization</b> of a doctor on a day is the sum of <code>minutes</code> of the non-cancelled bookings of that doctor that day, divided by <code>minutes_open</code>, in percent, rounded to 1 decimal. Only doctor-days that appear in <b>availability</b> with <code>minutes_open</code> greater than <code>0</code> are considered; a doctor-day with no booking has a utilization of <code>0</code>. Bookings on a doctor-day without availability are ignored.</p>\n<p>Your task is to rank the doctors of each day by utilization, the highest first, with <code>DENSE_RANK</code> (equal utilizations share the same rank), and return the rows with a rank of <code>1</code> or <code>2</code>: <code>day</code>, <code>doctor_id</code>, <code>utilization_pct</code> and <code>rnk</code>. Sort by <code>day</code>, then <code>rnk</code>, then <code>doctor_id</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>availability</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>doctor_id</th><th>day</th><th>minutes_open</th></tr><tr><td>d1</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>240</td></tr><tr><td>d2</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><td>d3</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><td>d4</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>d1</td><td>2026-03-03</td><td>60</td></tr></table></div><p>Table <code>bookings</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>booking_id</th><th>doctor_id</th><th>day</th><th>minutes</th><th>status</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>d1</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>60</td><td>done</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>d1</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>60</td><td>confirmed</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>d2</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>60</td><td>done</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>d3</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>90</td><td>cancelled</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>d4</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>30</td><td>done</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>d5</td><td>2026-03-03</td><td>30</td><td>done</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>day</th><th>doctor_id</th><th>utilization_pct</th><th>rnk</th></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>d1</td><td>50.0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>d2</td><td>50.0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>d3</td><td>0.0</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-03</td><td>d1</td><td>0.0</td><td>1</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["LEFT JOIN","NULLIF","DENSE_RANK","PARTITION BY","division entière"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"availability":{"columns":[["doctor_id","TEXT"],["day","DATE"],["minutes_open","INT"]],"rows":[["d1","2026-03-02",240],["d2","2026-03-02",120],["d3","2026-03-02",120],["d4","2026-03-02",0],["d1","2026-03-03",60]]},"bookings":{"columns":[["booking_id","INT"],["doctor_id","TEXT"],["day","DATE"],["minutes","INT"],["status","TEXT"]],"rows":[[1,"d1","2026-03-02",60,"done"],[2,"d1","2026-03-02",60,"confirmed"],[3,"d2","2026-03-02",60,"done"],[4,"d3","2026-03-02",90,"cancelled"],[5,"d4","2026-03-02",30,"done"],[6,"d5","2026-03-03",30,"done"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","doctor_id","utilization_pct","rnk"],"rows":[["2026-03-02","d1",50.0,1],["2026-03-02","d2",50.0,1],["2026-03-02","d3",0.0,2],["2026-03-03","d1",0.0,1]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"availability":{"columns":[["doctor_id","TEXT"],["day","DATE"],["minutes_open","INT"]],"rows":[["x","2026-03-05",100],["y","2026-03-05",100],["z","2026-03-05",100]]},"bookings":{"columns":[["booking_id","INT"],["doctor_id","TEXT"],["day","DATE"],["minutes","INT"],["status","TEXT"]],"rows":[[1,"x","2026-03-05",20,"done"],[2,"y","2026-03-05",20,"done"],[3,"z","2026-03-05",10,"done"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","doctor_id","utilization_pct","rnk"],"rows":[["2026-03-05","x",20.0,1],["2026-03-05","y",20.0,1],["2026-03-05","z",10.0,2]]}}],"hidden_n":7,"hidden":"","solution":""}